<h3><u>Watan tarasha</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Watan tarasha</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">(Lot ke aawo) x4 (Watan ko baba jaan) x3</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>(Watan Tarasha baba jaan) x2 Haey Baba Musafira</p>
<p>(Watan Tarasha baba jaan) x2 Haey Baba Musafira</p>
<p>(Nishta Sukoon baba jaan) x2 Haey baba Musafira</p>
<ol><li>Wai Da Ma Tanhai Da lala Zamaan Door De</li><p>Jism Sala baba jaan Qalb-e-Hazeen Choor De</p><p>Maray Gi Tanhai Yeh bhayi Mera Door Hai</p><p>Sath Meray Jism Kay Dil Bhi Mera Choor Hai </p><p>(Dil Ko Gham Jalaa Gaya) x2 Haey baba Musafira</p><p>(Watan Tarasha baba jaan) x2 Haey Baba Musafira</p><li>Poochti Hoon Dil Say main aap Ki Paheliyan</li><p>Dekhti Hoon Roz-o-Shab Apni Yeh Hatheliyan</p><p>Dukh Meray Aziz Hain Ghurbatein Saheliyan<br>
Aik mein Ghareeb Hoon Aur Bhari Hawliyan</p><p>(Aik Gham Sa Chaa Gaya) x2 Haey baba Musafira</p><p>(Watan Tarasha baba jaan) x2 Haey Baba Musafira</p><li>Baba jaan Sochuka Saey Zamaan Naseeb De</li><p>Sukh Zamaan Raqeeb De Dukh Zamaan Qareeb De</p><p>Baba jaan Sochieay Kia Mera Naseeb Hai</p><p>Sukh Meray Raqeeb Hain Dukh Meray Qareeb Hai</p><p>(Ab To Ghum Hi Bhaa gaya) x2 Haey baba Musafira</p><p>(Watan Tarasha baba jaan) x2 Haey Baba Musafira</p><li>Kia Taweel Gham Mila Mujh Ko Arz-o-Tool Ka</li><p>Tukrhe Tukrhe Hogaya baba Dil Malool Ka </p><p>Har Gali Mein Bain Hai dadi jaan batool Ka</p><p>Bujh Gaya Charagh Bhi Roza-e-Rasool Ka</p><p>(Mera Dil Bujhaa Gaya) x2 Haey baba Musafira</p><p>(Watan Tarasha baba jaan) x2 Haey Baba Musafira</p><li>Aghay Pa Gham Ke Jaarh Ma Da Zamaan Khushali Da</li><p>Gul Che Rana Laarh Zamaan Gul Shoyara Joand Zamaan</p><p>Us Kay Gham Mein Rona Hi Ab To Hai Meri Khushi</p><p>Jab Say Chala Gaya Gul Hui Hai Zindagi</p><p>(Zindagi Ka Kia Gayaa) x2 Haey baba Musafira</p><p>(Watan Tarasha baba jaan) x2 Haey Baba Musafira</p><li>Di Khizaan Ne Yeh Sada Ab Bahaar Chorh De</li><p>Apnay Har Qaraar Ko Be Qaraar Chorh De</p><p>Aankh Ki Umeed Ko Ashk Baar Chorh De</p><p>Keh Raha Hai Dil Mujhay Intezaar Chorh De</p><p>(Intezaar Khaa Gayaa) x2 Haey baba Musafira</p><li>Ghat Ghonde Yo Daagh Oo Husn P' Shabab Ke</li><p>Ror Akhpal Okato Maash Pe P' Khuwab Ke</p><p>Ek Barhaa Sa Daagh Tha Husn Kay Shabab Mein</p><p>Dekha Apnay bhayi Ko Raat Main Nay Khuwab Mein</p><p>(Khuwab Bhi Dukha Gayaa) x2 Haey baba Musafira</p><p>(Watan Tarasha baba jaan) x2 Haey Baba Musafira</p><li>Nauha Aur Hussain Ka Kab Bashar Ka Kaam Hai</li></ol>

<p>Zikr Is Imam Ka Zikr Ka Imam Hai</p>
<p>Karbala Usool Hai Karbala Payaam Hai</p>
<p>Karbala Ki Baat Hai Shaukat-e-Kalam Hai</p>
